/// Every recorded sound, by its path under `assets/sounds`.
///
/// **Compiled in, like the textures, and for the same reason**: the game
/// is one file, and an executable moved out of its folder should still
/// sound like the game rather than quietly go silent -- there are no
/// recipes behind these any more. At 3.8 MB this is a third of the
/// executable rather than three per cent, which is the price the player
/// asked for when they asked for real sounds and nothing generated -- and
/// Vorbis rather than WAV is why it is a third and not several times the
/// whole of it (see `audio::recorded`).
///
